      <h1 class="page-title">One maker. Every joint, every scribe.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I'm Joel Dyter. I've been a joiner and cabinet maker for more than {{ site.yearsTrade }} years, and I've run my own business since {{ site.established }}: first from a workshop in Old Town, and now from Unit 7 on the Pennine Industrial Estate in Hebden Bridge.</p>
