    <h2 class="section-title">What to expect</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>First conversation</h3><p>Tell me what you have in mind by phone, WhatsApp or the enquiry form. Photos of the space help a lot.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Site visit</h3><p>I'll visit, measure everything myself and talk through how you'll use the room.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Drawings &amp; a complete price</h3><p>Hand drawings so you can see it, and an itemised quote so there are no surprises.</p></li>
      <li><h3>In the workshop</h3><p>Your piece is made in Hebden Bridge. I'll keep you posted on progress, with photos.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Fitting &amp; finishing</h3><p>I fit everything myself and don't leave until it's right.</p></li>
    </ol>
